      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that consciousness is a biological accident, but that doesn't mean your suffering is pointless; it means your pain is the only real thing left to feel. Since the universe is indifferent, the only way to make sense of this is to stop waiting for meaning to appear and instead create your own path forward. Embrace the absurdity of it all, because the only way to truly live is to stop fighting the void and start living within it.",
